# STAGING TEMPLATE ONLY — do not enable without confirmed Cloudflare zone and valid Origin CA cert.
# Set Cloudflare DNS: phase-c -> <VPS PUBLIC IPV4> (Proxied).
# Cloudflare Full (strict) must be effective for this hostname; don't alter zone-wide settings
# without verifying the existing diaporia.com site.
#
# Provision Cloudflare Origin CA for phase-c.diaporia.com and install certificate/key
# on VPS, owned by root (key group caddy, mode 0640), never commit private key.
#
# Operator-only paths are intentionally blocked at the public reverse proxy.
# On the VPS, operator calls http://127.0.0.1:8791/operator/* over an SSH session.
# DIAPORIA seller-status verification uses /api/orders/status and remains available.
phase-c.diaporia.com {
    tls /etc/caddy/origin/phase-c.pem /etc/caddy/origin/phase-c.key

    @operator path /operator /operator/*
    respond @operator 403

    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8791
}
